Package: katu-update
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Katu OS Team <katuos@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt5 | python3-pyside6, katu-core
Priority: optional
Section: misc
Description: Katu Update — System Updates
 Graphical update manager for Katu OS. Check and install
 APT and Flatpak updates without using the terminal.
 Never reboots automatically without user confirmation.
